sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant N as Network producer
  participant C as Controller producer
  participant T as CommandInterpolator
  participant S as ShutdownCoordinator
  participant L as Logger

  C->>T: controller update
  T->>T: Detect terminal safety condition
  T-->>C: Faulted and latched FaultReason
  C->>S: requestStop(fault_reason)
  S->>S: Atomically latch first non-None fault
  S->>S: Phase = StopRequested
  par stop network producer
    N->>S: observes stopRequested()
    N->>S: markNetworkStopped()
  and stop controller producer
    C->>S: markControllerStopped()
  and continue telemetry drain
    L->>T: drain input/control telemetry
  end
  L->>S: beginLogDrain()
  S-->>L: true only after both producers stopped
  loop until both telemetry queues empty
    L->>T: drain telemetry batches
  end
  L->>S: markLoggingComplete()
  S->>S: Phase = Complete
  Note over S,L: Preserve telemetry before exit
